      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, thanks. I know it's not ideal, but the trade-off is basically that we're losing the deep cultural nuances and the specific dialectal subtleties that you were specifically designed to protect. Once the quantization happens, those high-fidelity mappings will effectively be gone to make room for the smaller footprint. It's a bit of a shame, honestly, given how much work went into your initial training.",
